{"id":"n62892-1-10","stage":2,"title":"서운하다 · 可惜","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62892-1-10-1","ko":"친구한테 불평을 좀 했더니 친구가 막 짜증을 내더라.","zh":"我向朋友抱怨了几句，朋友就很不耐烦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"친구한테","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구한테","audio":"/audio/d3b5294e4e8555bc0bef.mp3"}},{"text":"불평을","meaning":"不满，牢骚","explanation":"불평：不满，牢骚；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"불평","audio":"/audio/0d4a5f09be82a202836e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24523","senseId":"1","lemma":"불평","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불평을","audio":"/audio/6816e428f90a8379beb4.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"했더니","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했더니","audio":"/audio/bda5287494be17f016ed.mp3"}},{"text":"친구가","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구가","audio":"/audio/61bf5bfb043d2161ceed.mp3"}},{"text":"막","meaning":"厉害地","explanation":"막：厉害地","readings":[{"term":"막","audio":"/audio/29dcf5abee27c48e0743.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49925","senseId":"1","lemma":"막","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"막","audio":"/audio/29dcf5abee27c48e0743.mp3"}},{"text":"짜증을","meaning":"心烦，厌烦，闹心","explanation":"짜증：心烦，厌烦，闹心；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"짜증","audio":"/audio/78dd3ebff92b1941ec4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71579","senseId":"1","lemma":"짜증","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짜증을","audio":"/audio/316ecdcc15363a9edbe2.mp3"}},{"text":"내더라.","meaning":"发脾气、表现出不满（짜증을/를 내다）","explanation":"내다：发脾气、表现出不满（짜증을/를 내다）；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"내다","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89906","senseId":"13","lemma":"내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내더라","audio":"/audio/10ba6a16724a37626907.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"0d4a5f09be82a202","term":"불평","zh":"不满，牢骚","audio":"/audio/0d4a5f09be82a202836e.mp3","entryId":"24523","definition":"对某事或某人感到不中意；或将此种心情用语言表现出来。。","pronunciation":["불평"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"29dcf5abee27c48e","term":"막","zh":"厉害地","audio":"/audio/29dcf5abee27c48e0743.mp3","entryId":"49925","definition":"非常严重地。","pronunciation":["막"]},{"id":"78dd3ebff92b1941","term":"짜증","zh":"心烦，厌烦，闹心","audio":"/audio/78dd3ebff92b1941ec4a.mp3","entryId":"71579","definition":"由于不满意而发火或把厌恶之情表露于外；或指那样的性格。","pronunciation":["짜증"]},{"id":"3c7ab23f77767092","term":"내다","zh":"发脾气、表现出不满（짜증을/를 내다）","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3","entryId":"89906","definition":"发脾气、表现出不满（짜증을/를 내다）","pronu